OR</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10. Out of 10.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >11. AWESOME DAY/NIGHT CYCLE FUNCTION</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12. RAD ARCADE MINI GAMES FROM THE 80'S MAN</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2575440/extras/21f74a0f5e87626da82dbbd8ab3ba02e.poster.avif?t=1770826676\" width=456 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2575440/extras/21f74a0f5e87626da82dbbd8ab3ba02e.webm?t=1770826676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>13. COOL FAST TRAVEL SYSTEM</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14. UNIQUE BOSS DICE ROLL COUNTER SYSTEM</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15. COLLECTABLES, NES CARTS, VHSs, EQUIPMENT ECT.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16. AMAZING COMPUTER HACKING</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >17. STUNNING VARIOUS MULTIPLE ENDINGS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2575440/extras/bb70993d1503b81235e547dafb8f1ec5.poster.avif?t=1770826676\" width=456 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2575440/extras/bb70993d1503b81235e547dafb8f1ec5.webm?t=1770826676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18. FULL COLOR STATIC CUTSCENES, YEAH, FOR REAL </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >19. INTERCHANGEABLE HARDWARE AFFECTS ABILITIES  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HOW TO PLAY:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will need the following:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*One hand (Two hands optional) </p><p clas